      "id": "claim_726cb2fa6ff94b47ab3f52a1c357066a",
      "statement": "Task scheduling uses trigger mechanisms to determine which nodes execute: PUSH tasks from the TASKS channel (Send objects from conditional edges) and PULL tasks when at least one trigger channel has been updated since the node last processed it (detected via version comparison in versions_seen).",
