      "id": "claim_0ec65512b8c845798b0807b4a40126c5",
      "statement": "ChannelRead and ChannelWrite abstractions enable nodes to read and write state: ChannelRead is injected into task config and reads channels on-demand via local_read(); ChannelWrite wraps node output and appends writes to a task.writes deque, which are batched and applied atomically after all tasks complete.",
