    {
      "id": "claim_8f123fc501b34a2991e0a06ff09d21b5",
      "statement": "State advancement happens in apply_writes: channel versions are incremented for updated channels, versions_seen records are updated to reflect what each node has processed, and the checkpoint is saved before the next superstep begins (or writes are buffered depending on durability mode).",
