    {
      "id": "claim_5f525587ca674a3cac5673b37b10025f",
      "statement": "GraphInterrupt is raised at interrupt_before (before task execution if channels were updated) or interrupt_after (after writes applied); the checkpoint is saved and the graph pauses, allowing inspection and resumption with resume values.",
