      "id": "claim_683150c6507c495a9630e809c8abfa2d",
      "statement": "Error handlers are scheduled on task failure: if a node has an error_handler_node, NodeError is caught, ERROR and ERROR_SOURCE_NODE markers are written to checkpoint_pending_writes, and a fresh error handler task is prepared and added to self.tasks for execution in the same superstep.",
